************************************************************************************
* INPUT                                                                            *
************************************************************************************
electrodes.dat                :: File of electrode coordinates
data.dat                      :: File of resistance measurements
1                             :: Model file type (0=smooth, 1=voronoi)
grid.dat                      :: Resistivity model file
1                             :: Resistivities in model file are log10 (1=yes, 0=no)
forward.in                    :: Forward modelling file
************************************************************************************
* OUTPUT                                                                           *
************************************************************************************
resistances.out               :: File of resistances
apparentrho.out               :: File of apparent resistivities
************************************************************************************